<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RAND MINES LISTS TERMS OF FINAL UNBUNDLING.</title>
<headline>RAND MINES LISTS TERMS OF FINAL UNBUNDLING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rand Mines Ltd said on Wednesday its board of directors had determined the terms of the group's proposed final unbundling.</p>
<p>It said the unbundling would entail the distribution of 16.1-million Ingwe Coal Corporation shares in a ratio of 27 Ingwe shares for every 100 Rand Mines shares held.</p>
<p>The company added that it expected the unbundling to become unconditional on November 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
